 *This file should be stored in your APT: assigned directory.*
         To save scanning time delete this info text!

As can be seen from above, the Origin format is very easy to do.
The very first Line should be your DEFAULT origin line. This will be used
in any area that doesnt have a unique Origin defined.

To Define an Origin, Simply start a new line with the Hash "#" Character.
Then directly after the hash, enter the Areas number.
The VERY next line will be the Origin used for that area.

Remember to keep within the Maximum char length for Fidonet Origin text.
(Your origins will be CHOPPED if not!)
Current Max Length is 54 Chars. - Your Net: details are added onto that
taking the Origin line upto the maximum allowed.
